# Project Overview

This is a [Next.js](mdc:https:/nextjs.org) project using [React](mdc:https:/react.dev) and [TypeScript](mdc:https:/www.typescriptlang.org).

## IMPORTANT RULES:

### NEVER MODIFY SERVER STATE!
- DO NOT start development server
- DO NOT stop running server
- DO NOT restart server
- DO NOT run commands that affect server state

## Key Files and Directories

- **Dependencies**: Defined in [package.json](mdc:package.json).
- **Next.js Config**: Configuration for Next.js can be found in [next.config.js](mdc:next.config.js).
- **TypeScript Config**: TypeScript settings are in [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json).
- **Styling**: Uses [Tailwind CSS](mdc:https:/tailwindcss.com). Configuration is in [tailwind.config.ts](mdc:tailwind.config.ts) and PostCSS config is in [postcss.config.js](mdc:postcss.config.js). Global styles might be in `app/globals.css` (please verify).
- **Routing & Pages**: The application structure likely follows the Next.js App Router pattern, located in the [app/](mdc:app) directory. The main entry point could be [app/page.tsx](mdc:app/page.tsx).
- **UI Components**: Uses `shadcn/ui` base primitives in [components/ui/](mdc:components/ui). Form components organized in three layers: UI components → Form fields ([components/form/fields/](mdc:components/form/fields)) → Application components. Main form architecture is ConfigurableForm-based.
- **Utilities**: Helper functions in [lib/](mdc:lib). Includes Stellar blockchain integration ([lib/stellar/](mdc:lib/stellar)), form configurations ([lib/config/forms/](mdc:lib/config/forms)), and modular validation schemas ([lib/validation/schemas/](mdc:lib/validation/schemas)).
- **Hooks**: Form-related hooks in [hooks/](mdc:hooks), including network-aware account data loading and transaction generation.
- **Linting**: ESLint configuration is in [.eslintrc.json](mdc:.eslintrc.json).
- **Git Ignore**: Files ignored by Git are listed in [.gitignore](mdc:.gitignore).

## Key Features

### Stellar Network Integration
- **Dual Network Support**: Forms support both Stellar mainnet and testnet
- **Network-Aware Data Loading**: Account data automatically loads from selected network
- **Auto-Switching**: Form data reloads when network is changed
- **Sequence Number Safety**: Transactions use correct sequence numbers from target network
- **Smart Form Clearing**: Forms clear properly when switching to networks without data

### Configuration-Driven Forms  
- **ConfigurableForm Architecture**: ~20 line form configs instead of 1000+ line components
- **Three-Layer Component System**: UI primitives → Form fields → Application components
- **Auto-Loading Account Data**: Enter account ID → form auto-populates from blockchain
- **Change Detection**: Only modified fields included in transactions
